1
00:00:03,249 --> 00:00:07,426
A subscription can only be sent through an email provider.

2
00:00:07,426 --> 00:00:12,779
Under Settings, Email, this site says that no email provider is enabled yet.

3
00:00:13,232 --> 00:00:16,591
Back on the Features page, enable a provider.

4
00:00:16,591 --> 00:00:21,202
Here it is the SMTP provider, which sends through a mail server.

5
00:00:38,289 --> 00:00:42,520
The SMTP tab asks for the sender address, the host name and the

6
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:46,137
port, and for credentials when the server needs them.

7
00:00:46,137 --> 00:00:50,184
This site has no mail server, so these values point nowhere.

8
00:00:50,184 --> 00:00:52,759
On your site, enter your own server.

